---Cancel a repo's runner run
---
---Cancels a run at the user's request: the run and its latest prompt go terminal immediately, and the runner releases the sandbox the next time any of its handlers observes the canceled status. Canceled outranks every later terminal write, so a run whose prompt finishes moments afterwards cannot report success over the top of it. Answers 204 with no body — including for a run that had already settled on its own, since it too is stopped; read the run to see which status it settled on. A run still being provisioned 409s and can be cancelled again a moment later.
---
